    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "## Nvim 0.11.4 (or newer) is strongly preferred (soft-deprecates Nvim 0.10 and older)\n\n- https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/pull/4077\n    - `require'lspconfig'` is not supported on Nvim 0.11+. Use `vim.lsp.config` instead.\n- https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/issues/3898\n- previous:\n    - https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/pull/3692\n\n## nvim-lspconfig `v2.5.0` is the last release before soft-deprecation of Nvim 0.10:\n\nhttps://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/releases/tag/v2.5.0\n\n## nvim-lspconfig `v1.8.0` is the last release that supports Nvim 0.9:\n\nhttps://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/releases/tag/v1.8.0",
